<office:body><office:text><text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">A page layout without a size</text:h><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P01 hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P02 oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P03 victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P04 charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P05 juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P06 quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P07 xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P08 echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P09 lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P10 sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P11 zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Standard">P12 golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango whiskey zulu charlie foxtrot india lima oscar romeo uniform xray alpha delta golf juliet mike papa sierra victor yankee bravo echo hotel kilo november quebec tango.</text:p></office:text></office:body>
